#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:613
msgid ""
"Replace ``import sensor`` with ``import csi; csi0 = csi.CSI()`` and "
"translate every ``set_*``/``get_*`` call to its :class:`csi.CSI` accessor "
"(:ref:`the csi migration <v5_0_0_s1>`)."
msgstr ""
"Remplacer ``import sensor`` par ``import csi; csi0 = csi.CSI()`` et traduire"
" chaque appel ``set_*``/``get_*`` vers son accesseur :class:`csi.CSI` "
"(:ref:`la migration vers csi <v5_0_0_s1>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:616
msgid ""
"Wrap coordinate arguments to ``img.draw_*``, :meth:`~image.Image.get_pixel`,"
" and :meth:`~image.Image.set_pixel` in tuples (:ref:`the image module "
"changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"Encapsuler les arguments de coordonnées de ``img.draw_*``, "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_pixel` et :meth:`~image.Image.set_pixel` dans des "
"tuples (:ref:`les changements du module image <v5_0_0_s2>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:619
msgid ""
"Drop ``()`` from attrtuple result accessors if you want the new idiomatic "
"form, or leave the old style alone since attrtuples still support callable "
"accessors (:ref:`the image module changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"Abandonner les ``()`` des accesseurs de résultat attrtuple si vous voulez la"
" nouvelle forme idiomatique, ou laisser l'ancien style tel quel puisque les "
"attrtuples prennent toujours en charge les accesseurs appelables (:ref:`les "
"changements du module image <v5_0_0_s2>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:622
msgid ""
"Audit :meth:`~image.Image.find_line_segments`, "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_regression`, and any "
":meth:`~image.Image.find_apriltags` family choice (:ref:`the image module "
"changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"Auditer :meth:`~image.Image.find_line_segments`, "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_regression` et tout choix de famille "
":meth:`~image.Image.find_apriltags` (:ref:`les changements du module image "
"<v5_0_0_s2>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:626
msgid ""
"Rename ``timer_ms`` → ``poll_ms`` in :func:`protocol.init` calls; remove "
"``protocol.poll()`` and ``soft_reboot=`` (:ref:`the protocol module changes "
"<v5_0_0_s4>`)."
msgstr ""
"Renommer ``timer_ms`` → ``poll_ms`` dans les appels à :func:`protocol.init` "
"; supprimer ``protocol.poll()`` et ``soft_reboot=`` (:ref:`les changements "
"du module protocol <v5_0_0_s4>`)."

